=== Text #12 ===
> Really excited to[ be a] part[ of] the TrancefamilyUAE third birthday celebrations.
I have had the[ honour to be] part[ of the] last two events and each year the event grows from strength to strength.
[The] event this[ year is] over three days and features some massive international DJ’s. The whole event will be broadcast on TOA.fm You can listen on your browser on on your mobile device using the TuneIn radio app.
It is with great regret[ that I have to inform you that the] TFUAE Third Year[ Celebration has been moved to next] weekend[.
]We are experiencing severe technical issues with the station that have affected the show in everything but positive ways.[ Unfortunately] I[ will not be able to] provide[ you with the] quality that you deserve[. This] was a last resort decision[ that] was tough to make,[ but] a necessary[ one for] me to[ be] able to sort[ this out and] provide all of[ you] with[ an] epic show[.
]Spread the word with your fellow trancers!
I sincerely apologize for the inconvenience, but I promise you that the wait will be worth it[!]
